= Voter Protection Program

A democracy is only as strong as its election machinery. How do we protect it?

- @poll_watchers: Recruit and train poll workers and watchers
- @state_partners: Partner with state election officials
- @legal_war_chest: Build a legal war chest
- @easy_discard

@poll_watchers
on-arrival: election_admin += 4; civic_strength += 200; subversion_progress -= 0.3; pro_democracy += 0.5; month_actions += 1

Volunteers staff polling places and observe counts, defending both access and integrity.

@state_partners
on-arrival: election_admin += 3; institutions += 1; gopmod_relation += 4; progressive_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1

Nonpartisan officials, including Republicans, learn they can count on us to defend clean administration.

@legal_war_chest
subtitle: -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; election_admin += 3; voting_rights += 0.15; subversion_progress -= 0.5; month_actions += 1

Lawyers on retainer are ready for any challenge.
